"""tvremote — phone-friendly web remote for the Sony BRAVIA (wallpapers, slideshow, apps, keys).

  tvremote                 serve on :8765, print the iPhone URL (token required)
  tvremote --dir DIR       image folder (default: iCloud wallpaper/diwali/4k)
  tvremote --port 9000

On the iPhone: open the URL in Safari -> Share -> Add to Home Screen.
Reuses bin/tvwall for TV discovery (mDNS) and image push.
"""
